<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐδάκτῠλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>three-fingered</i> or
				<i>-toed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				354
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>three fingers long, broad,</i> etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					64.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				1443
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>C</u>
				116
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.44.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.69
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατέμνονται εἰς τριδάκτυλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Androm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριδάκτυλον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.103
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>having three dactyls,</i> with a play on signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				7.23
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
